## 🎯 Complete Workflow Example

```bash
#!/bin/bash
set -e

# Variables
REGISTRY="ghcr.io"
USERNAME="linhbonsochin"
IMAGE_NAME="attendance-service"
VERSION="1.0.0"

# Build
echo "🔨 Building Docker image..."
docker build -t $IMAGE_NAME:latest -f API/Dockerfile .

# Tag
